---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { store } from '../data/store';
---
<Layout title="Privacy" description={`What ${store.name} collects, and what it does not.`}>
	<div class="wrap page-head">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<p>Sample policy for a theme demo. Replace it with your own; it is not legal advice.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="wrap prose">
		<h2>This website</h2>
		<p>This site is a set of static pages. It sets no cookies, has no accounts and runs no analytics. Our host keeps standard server logs (IP address, page, time) for a short period for security.</p>
		<h2>When you buy</h2>
		<p>Checkout happens on Stripe. Stripe collects your name, email, shipping address and payment details and shares with us what we need to ship your order and answer you: your name, email, address and what you bought. We never see your card number. Stripe's own privacy policy applies to the checkout page.</p>
		<h2>The Ask box</h2>
		<p>When you ask a question about a product, your question and the text of that product page are sent from your browser to OneTag AI to write the answer. Do not type personal details into it. We do not receive or store your questions.</p>
		<h2>Email</h2>
		<p>If you email us, we keep the conversation for as long as it is useful for your order and our records, and never add you to a mailing list without asking.</p>
		<h2>Your rights</h2>
		<p>Ask us at <a href={`mailto:${store.email}`}>{store.email}</a> for a copy of what we hold about you, or to delete it once we no longer need it for tax records.</p>
	</div>
</Layout>
